Public data services
--------------------

GLEIF, SEC EDGAR, Wikidata, crt.sh, the Internet Archive Wayback Machine and
RDAP are queried over their public interfaces. No service code or proprietary
dataset is bundled except the Sherlock files listed above. Their data and
brands remain subject to their respective owners' terms.

The plugin does not scrape LinkedIn, X/Twitter, Instagram, Facebook, GSXT,
Tianyancha, Qichacha, Aiqicha or Chinese court-document sites. Where useful,
it returns deep links for the user to open manually.
